#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Harness doctor: everything that is not the model and makes a chat or worker wait, or slows the
machine for everyone. Collects into ~/.cache/harness-doctor/latest.json and lays it out as menu.txt,
which the LLM Limits menu renders as its Harness doctor block. Design: docs/harness-doctor-design.md."""

